        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion B5-0, Ribbon and Reed Round Rose Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nElegant in both shape and style, this Grade 2 deadbolt made by  A ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Deadbolt, Fusion Hardware's Ribbon and Reed design features the quiet yet elegant styling of French Colonial decor. Made out of solid brass, it is available in either brushed nickel or oil rubbed bronze finishes as either a single or a double cylinder.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion B5 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ribbon and Reed Round Rose Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
