                "description": "Ribbon and Reed Rose Deadbolt Fusion B5 - A ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Deadbolt, Fusion Hardware's Ribbon and Reed design features the quiet yet elegant styling of French Colonial decor. Made out of solid brass, it is available in either brushed nickel or oil rubbed bronze finishes as either a single or a double cylinder.",
